      this make sense? i dont wanna do for each","body":"should only be overlaping
      with spawn area collider, if its overlapping with anything else then its probably
      an ingredient","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"829cd1a6-417f-499b-9ec6-d3abb5f57675","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":1039.0,"yMin":-662.0,"xMax":1209.0,"yMax":-575.0},"title":"Sticky
      Note","body":"so we spawned one of each at start, now deal with left over spaces","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"ac672650-2746-4641-be23-49aaae4fe327","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":868.0,"yMin":392.0,"xMax":1114.0,"yMax":537.0},"title":"thinking","body":"get
      boundaries of the spawn area collider to get the range of x and y values\nrandomly
      select a spot and if its within and not taken spawn there\nif its not within
      try again\nig its taken pick another spot","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"5f3152f7-54aa-4262-8a7a-5e81f95d0527","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":2027.0,"yMin":-86.0,"xMax":2330.0,"yMax":40.0},"title":"thinking","body":"make
      sure there isnt already an ingredient there- create temp ingredient (disabled
      so it doesnt look weird) and then set position and check if that overlaps with
      anything and if it doesnt instantiate otherwise choose another position\n","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"1e2bb0ad-6a88-46b0-aebb-e54ae3abecbf","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":213.0,"yMin":743.0,"xMax":432.0,"yMax":892.0},"title":"thinkin","body":"when
      ingredient is parented to skewer this is triggered\nin takes the type of ingredient\n-->
      does check for at least 1\nif there is 1 then spawn random ingredient\nif there
      isnt replace it","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"ff935995-e194-4952-9fa2-8975e6a69ced","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":99.0,"yMin":-221.0,"xMax":199.0,"yMax":-121.0},"title":"Sticky
      Note","body":"initial spawn, pot starts filled","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"c3e947a9-6ae8-40da-8f7f-be417e017c3d","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":-200.6,"yMin":-309.0,"xMax":21.79999,"yMax":-193.0},"title":"Ingredient
      Manager Tasks","body":"Track how many ingredients are in pot, Make sure at
      least one of each ingredient is in pot, spawn them","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"2d77fd46-869c-4df5-9733-25dbefce8ec9","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":920.0,"yMin":-301.0,"xMax":1097.0,"yMax":-213.0},"title":"Sticky
      Note","body":"takes in what the ingredient type is (0-7, tells if its an onion
      or chicken)","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"77910873-8769-4eb6-b555-b84fd11b5124","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":1555.0,"yMin":840.0,"xMax":1680.0,"yMax":910.0},"title":"think","body":"spawn
      a random ingredient","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"2d71bf8e-2eb9-4076-b1c5-d808fa82ff55","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"}],"$version":"A"}}'
